l,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-11-08T12:50:52Z","updated_at":"2025-11-22T00:43:09Z","closed_at":"2025-11-22T00:42:38Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in Godot 4.6 dev 3\n- Not reproducible in Godot 4.6 dev 2\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.dev3 - macOS Tahoe (26.0.1) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Apple M4 Pro - Apple M4 Pro (14 threads) - 24.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe following issue came up in Godot 4.6 dev 3. It was working fine in Godot 4.6 dev 2:\n\nWhen playing an animation forward and then in a callback reacting to the animation_finished signal playing it backwards, the playback freezes. This is a regression from dev 2.\n\nA workaround is to place the pointer to the end before playing backwards: $AnimationPlayer.seek($AnimationPlayer.current_animation_length, true)\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nPlay an animation forward an play it backwards immediately when finished. See MRP.\n\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp-play_backwards.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23431859/mrp-play_backwards.zip)\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node2D\n\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar anim = $AnimationPlayer.get_animation(\"idle\")\n\tif anim:\n\t\tvar animlen = anim.length\n\t\tprint(\"idle length:\", animlen)\n\t\t\n\t$AnimationPlayer.play(\"idle\")\n\n\nfunc _on_animation_player_animation_finished(anim_name: StringName) -> void:\n\tprint(\"done '%s'\" % anim_name)\n\tprint(\"starting backwards '%s'\" % anim_name)\n\t# $AnimationPlayer.seek(7.0, true) # FIXME: This is needed in order to start playing backwards.\n\t$AnimationPlayer.play_backwards(\"idle\")\n\n\nfunc _on_animation_player_animation_started(anim_name: StringName) -> void:\n\tprint(\"started '%s'\" % anim_name)\n\n```\n\nExpected result:\n\n```\nidle length:7.0\nstarted 'idle'\ndone 'idle'\nstarting backwards 'idle'\nstarted 'idle'\ndone 'idle'\nstarting backwards 'idle'\nstarted 'idle'\n```\n(*continues endlessly*)\n\n\nActual result in 4.6 dev 3:\n\n```\nidle length:7.0\nstarted 'idle'\ndone 'idle'\nstarting backwards 'idle'\n```\n(*animation freezes*)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112540/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112540/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}